OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmainly die away this evening, leaving
OL,7,Fclear spells, then return later in the
OL,8,Fnight. Initially showers reach eastern
OL,9,Fareas, but may extend further west,
OL,10,Fperhaps becoming locally heavy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FOften cloudy with scattered
OL,13,Fshowers, these possibly heavy at times
OL,14,Fand also merging into long spells of
OL,15,Frain across eastern areas later.
OL,16,FFeeling cool. Becoming windy along the
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
