OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOften
OL,6,Fcloudy with a chance of patchy rain
OL,7,FMonday and Tuesday, but also some
OL,8,Fdrier periods. Potentially spells of
OL,9,Fheavy rain for Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,10,Fwill be generally near normal.
